1145
01:44:01,572 --> 01:44:05,158
His mother was a clinging , demanding woman ,

1146
01:44:06,660 --> 01:44:11,373
and for years the two of them lived as if there was no one else in the world .

1147
01:44:11,790 --> 01:44:13,584
